          <div class="container company-grid">
            <div class="company-sidebar">
              <span class="section-kicker">
                04 / COMPANY
              </span>

              <div class="company-index">
                <span>NeuraSyncApp</span>
                <span>Indonesia</span>
                <span>AI Creative Software</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="company-content">
              <h2>
                Building infrastructure behind
                <span>faster creative production.</span>
              </h2>

              <p class="company-lead">
                NeuraSyncApp is an AI software company building tools
                that make high-volume creative production faster, more
                controllable, and easier to operate.
              </p>

              <div class="company-columns">
                <div>
                  <h3>What we're building</h3>

                  <p>
                    Our first product, Affiliate Video Studio, is a
                    production workflow for short-form commerce
                    creators. It turns product assets and structured
                    inputs into editable vertical videos while keeping
                    creators in control of the final output.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h3>Initial market</h3>

                  <p>
                    We are initially focused on Indonesian short-form
                    affiliate commerce, including localized scripts,
                    voice-over, captions, calls-to-action, and common
                    creator production patterns.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="company-details">
                <div>
                  <span>Company</span>
                  <strong>NeuraSyncApp</strong>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <span>Founded</span>
                  <strong>2026</strong>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <span>Based in</span>
                  <strong>Indonesia</strong>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <span>Contact</span>
                  <a href="mailto:hello@neurasyncapp.com">
                    hello@neurasyncapp.com
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <section class="cta-section">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="cta-card">
              <div class="cta-grid"></div>

              <div class="cta-content">
                <span class="section-kicker">
                  NEURASYNCAPP
                </span>

                <h2>
                  The operating layer for
                  <span>AI-assisted creative production.</span>
                </h2>

                <p>
                  We are actively developing NeuraSyncApp as we move
                  from early product development toward broader creator
                  usage.
                </p>

                <a
                  href="mailto:hello@neurasyncapp.com"
                  class="button button-primary"
                >
                  Contact NeuraSyncApp

                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path
                      d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"
                      fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.7"
                      stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round"
                    />
                  </svg>
                </a>
